# Implementation Plan: in-progress-phase-columns

This plan implements the approved design, revision 2 (overlapping phase lanes). The user accepted every open question at its default:

| Open question | Approved default |
|---|---|
| OQ1 | Include `implementation` as a marker |
| OQ2 | Geometry as specified: minimum card 11rem, collapse below 14rem, literal step 20% |
| OQ3 | Keep the `xl` 1fr:2fr:1fr board grid |
| OQ4 | Cache-busting `app.css` is out of scope; suggest a follow-up only |
| OQ5 | Local gate: no new failures against the captured baseline, plus targeted race runs |
| OQ6 | No change to the `begin_task` skill |
