    - `"lanes not (min-width:14rem)"`
    - `class="lane lane-research"`
    - `data-phase="research"`
    - `class="lanes"`
    - `<article`
    - `>0</span>`
    - `class="meta truncate" title=...`
    - `break-words`
  - Wording rule S5 follows from this.
